1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Methods) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Events are accumulated into 4 temporal bins of 25 milliseconds each.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (The detector was trained on 14,200 labelled clips from 3 forest sites.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (Clips were labelled by two ecologists who marked the species and a bounding box.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm (Light levels were measured with a calibrated lux meter placed next to the camera.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm (We report recall because false negatives matter most for population surveys.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 660 Tm (Each site contributed clips from both summer and winter recording periods.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 645 Tm (Training used a fixed learning schedule without any per-site tuning at all.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 630 Tm (Test clips come from recording nights that were not used during training.) Tj T* ET
.6 g
0 g
 
endstream
