1 0 0 1 0 0 cm  BT /F1 12 Tf 14.4 TL ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 13.2 TL ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Discussion) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (The event camera consumed 0.9 W compared with 2.6 W for the infrared reference camera.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (Lower power allows longer deployments on the same battery in remote locations.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 705 Tm (Detection below 0.5 lux may need longer bins or a more sensitive sensor model.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 690 Tm (Branch motion remains the main source of errors and needs better filtering.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 675 Tm (Our sites were temperate forests, so other habitats may behave differently.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 660 Tm (Species with little motion at night are hard to detect with events alone.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 645 Tm (A combined event and infrared system could cover both situations in future.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 630 Tm (Ethics approval covered passive recording only, without any animal handling.) Tj T* ET
.6 g
0 g
 
endstream
