BT 1 0 0 1 35 750 Tm (Conclusion) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 735 Tm (Event cameras detect nocturnal wildlife reliably down to about 2 lux at low power.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 35 720 Tm (Per-species values should be read from Figure 3 in the original file.) Tj T* ET
